# 10. Stage 7 — Learn APIs and networking

Once you understand web applications, learn how applications communicate.

Start with:

```text
HTTP
URL
Request
Response
Header
Body
Status code
Cookie
Session
JSON
REST
```

Then build:

```text
Client
   │
   │ HTTP
   ↓
REST API
   │
   ↓
Database
```

For example:

```http
GET /api/products
```

might produce:

```json
[
    {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Book",
